---
title: LetterRequest lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Submitted : student submits request (UC-04)

    Submitted --> UnderVerification : system runs CompletionCheck
    Submitted --> Cancelled : student withdraws request

    UnderVerification --> AwaitingApproval : [CompletionCheck.outcome = Eligible] / FR-08
    UnderVerification --> Refused : [CompletionCheck.outcome = Not Eligible] / FR-07, FR-08
    UnderVerification --> VerificationFailed : academic record cannot be retrieved

    VerificationFailed --> UnderVerification : record becomes available / retry
    VerificationFailed --> Cancelled : retry limit reached

    AwaitingApproval --> Approved : RegistryOfficer approves / FR-10
    AwaitingApproval --> Refused : RegistryOfficer rejects with reason / FR-10

    Approved --> LetterIssued : CompletionLetter generated with VerificationCode / FR-11, FR-13

    LetterIssued --> Delivered : letter sent to institutional email / FR-12
    LetterIssued --> DeliveryFailed : delivery not confirmed in window

    DeliveryFailed --> LetterIssued : resend attempted
    DeliveryFailed --> Delivered : delivery confirmed on retry

    Delivered --> Revoked : letter withdrawn, VerificationCode.isRevoked = true

    Refused --> Submitted : student resubmits after record updated / FR-09
    Refused --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Delivered --> [*]
    Revoked --> [*]

    note right of UnderVerification
        Guarded by CompletionCheck against
        the Enrolment's CompletionRequirement
        set (see D-002 Decision 2)
    end note

    note right of Refused
        ApprovalDecision records the outcome
        and reason even when no letter is
        produced (see D-002 Decision 4)
    end note
